Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,Medicine's greatest discovery happened
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.84,0:00:04.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,because a scientist didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.15,0:00:05.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,wash his dishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.64,0:00:06.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,London,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.42,0:00:08.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,nineteen twenty-eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.10,0:00:10.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,Alexander Fleming was brilliant,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.51,0:00:11.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,and his lab bench
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:13.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,was a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.37,0:00:14.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,Dishes of bacteria
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.54,0:00:16.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,were stacked everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:16.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,some old enough
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.99,0:00:18.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,to need their own name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.52,0:00:19.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,That summer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:20.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,he went on holiday
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.55,0:00:21.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,and left the whole
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.45,0:00:22.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,pile behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.65,0:00:23.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,When he came back,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.72,0:00:24.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,one dish had grown
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.77,0:00:26.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,a fuzzy blue-green mould.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.78,0:00:27.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,Gross,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.11,0:00:28.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,but normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.61,0:00:30.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,Except around the mould,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.78,0:00:32.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,the bacteria were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.66,0:00:33.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,Not dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.83,0:00:34.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.78,0:00:35.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,Like someone had drawn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.81,0:00:36.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,a circle and said,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.82,0:00:37.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,keep out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.94,0:00:38.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,Fleming grew more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.88,0:00:40.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,of the mould and tested
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:41.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,its juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:42.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,It wiped out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:43.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,germs that killed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.01,0:00:44.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,people every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.60,0:00:46.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,But here's the catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.12,0:00:46.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,He couldn't make
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.70,0:00:47.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,enough of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.72,0:00:49.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,and almost nobody cared.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:50.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,For ten years,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.80,0:00:51.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,the miracle sat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.98,0:00:53.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,on a shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.29,0:00:53.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then a team
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.85,0:00:55.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,in Oxford figured out how
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.35,0:00:55.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,to brew it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:00:57.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,by the bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.08,0:00:58.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,Soon factories were making
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.69,0:01:00.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,millions of doses,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:01.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,and simple scratches
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.09,0:01:02.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,stopped being deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.88,0:01:03.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.34,0:01:04.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,the mould probably
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.49,0:01:04.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,drifted
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.95,0:01:06.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,in from a lab downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.77,0:01:08.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,Fleming's real genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.39,0:01:09.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,He looked before
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.44,0:01:10.47,Cap,,0,0,0,,he scrubbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.47,0:01:10.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,He won
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.79,0:01:11.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,a Nobel Prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:12.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,And to this day,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.48,0:01:14.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,the most important dish
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.12,0:01:15.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,in history is
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.49,0:01:16.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,the one he forgot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.85,0:01:17.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,to wash.
